# Note — context

Personal notes app: browser-like tabs; each tab holds notes (regular / important / trash).
No auth in MVP. One shared dataset per instance.

## Clients
- Web: React SPA → REST `/api`
- Future: Flutter (same API + Swagger)

## Stack
Laravel 12 API + l5-swagger | React+TS+Tailwind | SQLite (local)

## Domains
- Tab: container; sort by last_note_at
- Note: belongs to Tab; kind=regular|important|trash; sort by updated_at

